  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "I aim to create a superb new galette that will\ntranscend even the mighty Lumiose Galette!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yet there is a problem with my superb plan...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590065007400200074006800650072006500200069007300200061002000700072006F0062006C0065006D002000770069007400680020006D0079002000730075007000650072006200200070006C0061006E002E002E002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t have a wonderfully gallant Pokémon to\nhelp present my superb galettes to customers.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But the very name of our café is Café Gallant!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020007400680065002000760065007200790020006E0061006D00650020006F00660020006F00750072002000630061006600E9002000690073002000430061006600E9002000470061006C006C0061006E0074002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps wanting to be seen as gallant is behind\nthe times, but it IS in the name of our café...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI want to respect our history and the desires that\nwent into that name.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 175
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Forgive me—I suppose I got off topic there...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe point is that I want a gallant and classy\nPokémon who can help deliver my superb<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ngalettes to customers with style!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 175
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please help me get that most gallant of Pokémon,\nthe effortlessly cool Indeedee!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you have an Indeedee you can give me?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F00750020006800610076006500200061006E00200049006E00640065006500640065006500200079006F0075002000630061006E002000670069007600650020006D0065003F00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve got one!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004920190076006500200067006F00740020006F006E006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not yet...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007900650074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Truly?! Oh, having an Indeedee here would be\nworth any number of human workers!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, please! I must have an Indeedee! I am\nconvinced it is the only Pokémon that’ll do!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If only I had a gallant Indeedee...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900660020006F006E006C007900200049002000680061006400200061002000670061006C006C0061006E007400200049006E006400650065006400650065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes! The gallantry! It simply pours off of Indeedee!\nThis is exactly it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes! The gallantry! All Indeedee are most gallant.\nGal-lant, you might say in this case!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now, to prepare my superb Lumiose Galette that\nshall transcend standard Lumiose Galettes!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I shall call them...Giga Lumiose Galettes! That’s\nright, we’re skipping right over Mega!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis is the kind of brilliant thinking and decisive\naction that is needed to be truly gallant!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 191
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Indeedee! Please present our customer with\nsome Giga Lumiose Galettes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh. Hmm. They’re so large that there is no room\nto serve coffee or anything else alongside them...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps gallantry should know some limits.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500720068006100700073002000670061006C006C0061006E007400720079002000730068006F0075006C00640020006B006E006F007700200073006F006D00650020006C0069006D006900740073002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But at least I still get to see Indeedee’s gallant\nservice—and that’s something to celebrate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Indee.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E006400650065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Indeedee! Together you and I shall bring further\nglory to Café Gallant!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Since my Giga Lumiose Galette turned out too big,\nI’m reconsidering the Mega Lumiose Galette...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
